28:36.340 --> 28:36.750
Ya.

28:37.750 --> 28:38.750
Agak terang.

28:42.940 --> 28:44.010
Apa kata

28:44.710 --> 28:45.900
kita pergi tengok Lan

28:45.900 --> 28:47.560
